hifiberry-auth (0.1.3) stable; urgency=medium

  * Restart on manifest changes via a dpkg trigger on /etc/hifiberry/auth.d.
    Manifests were only read at startup and nothing restarted the service when
    a package shipped one, so on a fresh install hifiberry-auth came up as a
    dependency before configurator and audiocontrol dropped theirs, classified
    every endpoint as risky and 401'd the entire web UI.

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Sat, 01 Aug 2026 09:00:00 +0000

hifiberry-auth (0.1.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Version bump only. Supersedes an ad-hoc 0.1.1 build (argon2 exception
    portability fix) that was never recorded in this changelog, so the released
    package version stays ahead of anything already deployed. The argon2 fix is
    included.

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Fri, 17 Jul 2026 13:00:00 +0000

hifiberry-auth (0.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: session + password store, classification manifests, the
    nginx auth_request verify endpoint, and the auth API.

 -- HiFiBerry <support@hifiberry.com>  Thu, 17 Jul 2026 09:00:00 +0000
